---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Sphoorthi" description="FA4C's medical and blood donation programme inspiring communities through health awareness.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/our-programmes/" class="hover:text-[#1a6b3c]">Our Programmes</a> / <span class="text-gray-800">Sphoorthi</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1a6b3c] mb-2">Sphoorthi <span class="text-2xl">🩸</span></h1>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#e87722] mb-8"></div>

    <img src="/images/2016/05/Spoorthi.png" alt="Sphoorthi Programme" class="rounded-xl shadow-md mb-8 mx-auto max-h-72 object-contain" />

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700">
      <p>
        A person who helps the other person during a medical emergency always stands as an inspiration to the rest of the people. All the medical related programmes we do are considered as a part of 'Sphoorthi'.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1a6b3c] mt-8 mb-4">Our Activities</h2>
      <ol class="space-y-2">
        <li>Blood donation drives and camps.</li>
        <li>Organ donation awareness programmes.</li>
        <li>Medical health camps for underprivileged communities.</li>
        <li>First aid and health awareness workshops.</li>
        <li>Partnering with hospitals and medical organisations for outreach.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="/our-programmes/" class="border border-[#1a6b3c] text-[#1a6b3c] font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#1a6b3c] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm">← All Programmes</a>
      <a href="/contribute-now/" class="bg-[#e87722] text-white font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#d06820] transition-colors text-sm">Support This Programme</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
